      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Batavia Branch Rail Line, nicknamed the “Peanut Line,” ran through West Bloomfield for almost a century, boosting local commerce until 1939.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
